Goal

Build a local Billplz payment simulator for development and testing.

I cannot conveniently test the full Billplz payment flow on localhost, especially Online Banking and Credit Card flows.

The simulator must allow the existing Laravel backend and both existing Next.js checkout applications to run through the complete payment lifecycle locally:

Checkout
→ Laravel creates a Billplz bill
→ Laravel receives a simulator payment URL
→ Customer opens the simulated hosted payment page
→ Customer selects a test payment result
→ Simulator sends a callback to Laravel
→ Simulator redirects the browser to the configured redirect URL
→ Laravel validates the signature and payment data
→ Laravel updates the ecommerce order or booking payment
→ Frontend displays the correct final or pending status

This simulator is for local development only.

It must not replace or weaken the real Billplz Sandbox or Production integration.

